  "description": "The ASP.NET Core host of a desktop app's loopback backend: listen on 127.0.0.1 only, announce the port the system picked or publish it in an owner-only discovery file, answer only registered callers (open routes by name), refuse non-loopback Host names, report unexpected failures without their messages, take a request to quit, and quit when the app that started it is gone. Pairs with the tauri-kit-sidecar crate's loopback feature.",
